<p>All of them, I think. I gave it a try in my sandbox. It's very very <em>terrible.</em> Basically, it's a vast, anciet indestructible feline-canine made of spherical-cubes from the future that fights good, has reality bending powers, everyone loves him, turns into a statue that moves when you're not looking when he wants to sleep, if you touch him in statue mode you either go insane or get transported into a vast dimension of nothingness, and he created all of the most powerful SCPs. He also caused the Indian Ocean Tsunami by accident. And since we don't wanna make him angry all resources go into making him comfortable.</p>

